    skos:changeNote
        "2021-04-07 - replace local lithology concepts with common lithology concepts from Substrate" ,
        "2021-04-08 - replace local material strength concepts with common material strength concepts from Substrate" ,
        "2022-07-26 - add observable-properties collection" ,
        "2022-07-26 - removed dcterms:description and rdfs:label - duplicates skos:definition andskos:prefLabel" ,
        "2022-07-29 - replace `sosa:ObservableProperty` type on enumerations with `skos:related` link to the OP in the domain model" ,
        "2022-11-23 - Rename collections for consistency with ANSIS" ,
        "2022-12-07 - remove observable-properties collection" ,
        "2026-09-20 - Updated to be VocPub conformant" ;
    skos:definition """This vocabulary is a machine-readable representation of the classifiers described in chapter 7 Land Surface, by R.C. McDonald, R.F. Isbell and J.G. Speight, in Australian soil and land survey field handbook (3rd edn).
Land surface is concerned mainly with surface phenomena affecting land use and soil development that have traditionally been noted at the point of soil observation."""@en ;
